---
import Layout from "../layouts/About.astro";
import guards from "../../data/guards.json";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import heroImage from "../assets/placeholders/blog-placeholder-about.jpg";
---

<style>
  li a p {
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>


<Layout
  title="Who We Are"
  author="Fifteenth Guard Staff"
  description=""
  pubDate={new Date("August 13 2025")}
  heroImage={heroImage}
  heroImageAlt="Placeholder image with a smiling face"
  featured={false}
  imageType="Placeholder"
  tags={new Array("Uncategorized")}
>
<div style="width: 80%; margin-inline: auto;">
  <p>
    <!-- (Fifteenth Guard description) -->
     The Reckoner is Marc Garneau Collegiate Institute’s official student-run publication. Publishing news, editorial, and creative writing pieces, as well as student artwork and photography, The Reckoner distributes content both online and in person through quarterly print editions. In The Reckoner’s debut year, 2011, it was awarded the Toronto Star High School Newspaper Award’s first-place titles for Best Electronic Newspaper, Best Electronic Layout and Design, Best Critical Writing, and Best Editorial Writing. In its second year, 2012, The Reckoner published its first print issue, distributing 2000 copies of newsprint throughout the school. The Reckoner continues to receive enthusiastic responses from the school community and remains an invaluable resource for student expression.
  </p>
  <p>
     For inquiries, please contact the EICs of the Fifteenth Guard at <a href="mailto:editorinchief@thereckoner.club">editorinchief@thereckoner.club</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    <!-- (General description) -->
  </p>

  <p>
    Below are the members of The Reckoner's Fifteenth Guard. Previous
    guards can be found here:
  </p>
  <ul>
    {
      guards.map(({ guard_name, guard_title }) => (
        (guard_title !== "Fifteenth Guard") && (<li> <!--change to const current in import -->
          <a href={`/about/${guard_name}`}>
            <p style="display: inline;">{guard_title}</p>
          </a>
        </li>)
      ))
    }
  </ul>
</div>
</Layout>
